  "title": "Cinnamon-Pumpkin Streusel Bundt® Cake",
  "description": "Canned pumpkin and Saigon® cinnamon bring fall-inspired flavor to this moist Bundt® cake, baked with a sweet streusel to take it over the top.",
  "authors": [
    "thedailygourmet"
  ],
